flowchart TD
  A[SPA Request\ncookie + X-CSRF-Token] --> B[Nginx\nTLS / proxy]
  B --> C[Fastify: Helmet + CORS]
  C --> D[Global Rate Limit\nRedis 120/60s per IP]
  D --> E{State-changing?}
  E -- yes --> F[CSRF Validation\ndouble-submit]
  E -- no --> G[AuthGuard\nsession lookup]
  F --> G
  G --> H["PermissionGuard\n@RequirePermissions"]
  H --> I[EntityScopeGuard\nentity visibility]
  I --> J[Zod DTO Validation]
  J --> K[Module Service\nraw SQL in transaction]
  K --> L[(PostgreSQL commit\n+ ops.outbox_events)]
  L --> M[Outbox Dispatcher\npolls every 10s]
  M --> N[BullMQ Enqueue]
  N --> O[Worker Processes Job]
  O --> P[Email / Export / Projection]
  K --> Q[RFC 7807 JSON Response]
  G -. invalid .-> R[401 Unauthorized]
  H -. denied .-> S[403 Forbidden]
  D -. exceeded .-> T[429 Too Many Requests]
